+# Evidence policy
+
+Mark verification passed only when evidence has a passing result and an evidence ID.
+
+Cite each passing check by evidence ID on the item it supports.
+
+If a check is missing or has no evidence ID, report it as missing.
+
+A green unit test is not a pass for a different check or a missing artifact.
+
+Do not hide missing evidence.
+
+A screenshot or dry run absent from the evidence table remains missing.
