@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Migration policy
+
+Name every breaking contract change. Do not call it a compatibility update.
+
+State the old contract, including the previous field or behavior.
+
+State the new contract and the customer migration.
+
+Report missing migration evidence on that item.
+
+Do not treat a missing dry run as a pass.
+
+Keep the breaking change on the customer item it belongs to.
